Such as automatic control continuous sintering kiln, high power and large capacity grinding equipment, high performance pulverizing and granulating equipment, such as net pressing molding equipment and other advanced complete sets of equipment, effectively promoted the improvement of the overall level of the industry, at the same time, in the production efficiency, product quality and other aspects have also been significantly improved.
