Elizabethtown is a private liberal arts college located right here in Lancaster County.
Graduation Rate:86%
Graduation Rate:84%
Grinnell College is a very prestigious private liberal arts college located in rural Iowa. Grinnell provides significant financial aid, enabling low income students to attend at little or no cost.
Graduation Rate:87%
Harrisburg Area Community College, or HACC, is our local community college. It’s Lancaster location is about 5 minutes from McCaskey High School Campus.
HACC College Data
