Pennsylvania College of Health Sciences is a dual enrollment partner of School District of Lancaster. In addition, they partner with SDoL on the Health Care Careers Academy program.
Thaddeus Stevens is a dual enrollment partner; students can complete their entire senior year at the college at no cost. Thaddeus Stevens provides the Stevens Grant where low income students can qualify for a significant scholarship, typically covering most or all of the cost of attendance.
