Students should be waiting at their assigned bus stop at least 5 minutes before their scheduled stop time. Students must get on and off the bus at their designated stop.
Parents or guardians of kindergarten students must be at the bus stop to receive their child.
There is a 10 foot danger zone around the school bus. If your child must cross a street, they should cross in front of the bus and at least 10 feet away in order to be visible to the driver.
