If you or someone you know is thinking of harming themselves, the following hotlines can offer you immediate assistance at any time:
The National Suicide Prevention Lifeline provides free and confidential emotional support to people in suicidal crisis or emotional distress – 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.
The School District of Lancaster is in the third phase of a four-phase, master facilities plan to renovate, refurbish and rebuild its school facilities to ensure students attend safe, modern and fully-equipped schools for 21st century learning.
Reynolds Middle School: A $25.5 million renovation that was featured in a national trade publication for its refurbished design that added common spaces, modernized the interior yet preserved the historic architecture. Opened in 2019.
Smith-Wade-El Elementary School: Construction of a new $21.6 million, 61,000 square foot building on district land between the former Buchanan Elementary and Wheatland Middle School. Completed summer 2021.
Dual Language Immersion in the School District of Lancaster is a lottery-based special program designed for both native Spanish speakers and non-native Spanish speakers. Studies show that there are many benefits of knowing more than one language, including the positive impact on students’ academic achievement.
Instruction in kindergarten through fifth grade is conducted in both English and Spanish so that students have opportunities to learn concepts in both languages. All Dual Language classes are located at Wharton Elementary School.
If you haven’t enrolled your child in kindergarten, please go to our enrollment page.
Child's Birthdate *
Enrollment in the Dual Language Immersion program is open to any incoming SDoL kindergarten student and is determined by random lottery. Students must have completed registration for kindergarten to be eligible.
Families who do not wish to have their child participate may turn down their slot. New students will be selected at random and offered spaces until the class is filled.
Transportation can be provided upon request.
