The School District of Lancaster believes in promoting and sustaining a positive school environment where all members feel welcomed, supported and safe in school: socially, emotionally, intellectually and physically. That’s why we embrace initiatives like Positive Behavior Interventions and Supports, restorative practices and a School Resource Officer program that allows local police officers to develop relationships with students and families.
