There are varieties of ways that you can team up to collaborate with the District; from volunteering in a classroom to read to students, to leading a program for after school enrichment; SDoL welcomes all forms of partnership as we work together to create the best opportunities for all of our students.
How can I get involved?
There are so many ways to partner with us. Whether you are a parent interested in volunteering with a classroom; you’re a local community organization looking to provide after-school opportunities through the Extended Day program; you’d like to make a donation to support the work of SDoL or sponsor a school district venue ; or maybe you are a faith-based organization that would like to get involved in supporting students and families; we have opportunities for you!
If you are new to partnering with SDoL, have a question about our processes or procedures, or you are curious to learn more, please complete the form below and we will be in touch very soon.
