Talk to your child BEFORE going to the conference. Ask them if there is anything in particular you should talk about with their teacher or anything you as the adult need to know beforehand.
Emphasize the POSITIVE focus of the conference. We want your child to be excited that you are talking with their teacher!
In what areas does my child need to grow?
Does my child need extra help in any areas?
Can you show me samples of my child’s writing?
As the parent, what can I do to support my child?
What are my child’s strengths this school year?
Is my child performing on grade level?
Does my child ask questions when they do not understand?
We recommend 10 minutes early for in-person conferences or logging onto zoom 5 minutes before your scheduled conference.
If you are on zoom find a location where you can focus on the conference.
