Fashion jewelry tends to be more exaggerated and is a choice to conform to fashion, mainly to match clothing. Modern is full, but because of the different shapes of fashion jewelry, often precious metals can not meet, so some gold-plated materials are more popular, and even use alloys to meet the needs of modeling.
